    "body_html": "<p data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"283\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Don't let the size fool you... <span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">Each </span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">35g protein ball contains</span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\"> a massive </span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">10g of protein</span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\"> into just </span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">129 calories, </span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\">making it a convenient high protein snack!</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"772\">Made with dates, peanut butter and whey protein, these bites have a soft, fudgy texture that stays moist and delicious even straight from the fridge. Perfect as a post-workout snack, an afternoon pick-me-up or something sweet after dinner that won't make you feel heavy.</p>\n<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"772\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">✓ 10g Protein Per Ball<br data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"906\">✓ Only 129 Calories<br data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"932\">✓ 35g Per Bite<br data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\">✓ Soft &amp; Moist (Even Refrigerated)<br data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"994\">✓ Made with Real Dates &amp; Peanut Butter<br data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1039\">✓ Handmade Fresh Weekly</p>\n<p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"772\"><strong>Nutritional Facts</strong></p>\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100.087%; height: 117.563px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 43.4924%; height: 19.5938px;\"> </td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.1574%; height: 19.5938px;\">Amount Per Serving (35g per ball)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 43.4924%; height: 19.5938px;\">Calories</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.1574%; height: 19.5938px;\">129</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 43.4924%; height: 19.5938px;\">Protein</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.1574%; height: 19.5938px;\">10g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 43.4924%; height: 19.5938px;\">Fats</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.1574%; height: 19.5938px;\">4g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 43.4924%; height: 19.5938px;\">Carbs</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.1574%; height: 19.5938px;\">15g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 43.4924%; height: 19.5938px;\">Sugar</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.1574%; height: 19.5938px;\">6.6g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Ingredients: Whey protein blend (milk), quick oats, pitted dates, sugar-free maple flavoured syrup, high-protein almond milk (almonds), powdered peanut butter (peanuts), natural peanut butter (peanuts), shredded coconut.</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Contains: Milk, Peanuts, Almonds.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Shelf Life &amp; Storage</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"g3znyq\" data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"295\">Shelf life: 7 days when refrigerated.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xgz3kd\" data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"349\">Storage: Keep refrigerated at 5°C or below.</li>\n</ul>"
