    "body_html": "<p>Start your morning with our <strong>High Protein Overnight Weet-Bix</strong> made with class Weet-Bix, Biscoff crumbs, vanilla YoPRO yoghurt, whey protein, high-protein almond milk and chia seeds, drizzled with Biscoff spread.</p>\n<p>Designed for busy mornings, this ready-to-eat breakfast delivers slow release carbs, high protein and sustained energy to keep you fuelled throughout the day.</p>\n<p>✔ High protein<br>✔ Slow-release carbs<br>✔ Ready-to-eat<br>✔ Filling!<br>✔ Made in small batches</p>\n<p><strong>Available as an add-on with minimum 5 main meals.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Nutrition Facts</strong></p>\n<p>Serving size: 1 (net weight 200g)</p>\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100.107%; height: 58.7814px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.46%; height: 19.5938px;\">Calories</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.108%; height: 19.5938px;\">373</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.46%; height: 19.5938px;\">Protein</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.108%; height: 19.5938px;\">25g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 49.46%; height: 19.5938px;\">Fats</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.108%; height: 19.5938px;\">10g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.46%;\">Carbohydrates</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.108%;\">46g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Nutrition values are approximate and may vary slightly.</span></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Ingredients: High protein almond milk, <strong>vanilla protein yoghurt</strong>, Weet-Bix, <strong>whey protein</strong>, black chia seeds, Biscoff crumbs and spread.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Shelf Life &amp; Storage</span></strong></p>\n<p><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Prepared fresh, this Overnight Weet-Bix is safe to consume up to <strong>5 days when refrigerated</strong> (see best before date).</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"><br>For the best taste and texture, we recommend enjoying within <strong>2–3 days</strong>. </span><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Keep refrigerated at or below 5°C.</span></p>"
